    "title": "2025 Chevrolet Corvette Stingray Price, Specs, Features & Review | Lincoln, NE",
    "text": "Skip to main content We'll Buy Your Car Even If You Don't Buy From Us. Click Here 2025 CHEVROLET CORVETTE STINGRAY MODEL REVIEW - Lincoln, NE What's New for the 2025 Chevrolet Corvette Stingray?This mid-engine sports car makes its 2025 return with two fresh exterior hues: Competition Yellow Tintcoat Metallic and Hysteria Purple Metallic. It also debuts two new interior color schemes. In addition, the Corvette Stingray's optional equipment list now features Velocity Yellow brake calipers and a leather-wrapped steering-wheel airbag cover. The available Z51 Performance Package now comes with a redesigned rear spoiler.What Are the 2025 Corvette Stingray Trims & Features?Chevy presents the new Corvette Stingray in both coupe (with removable roof panels) and convertible body styles. Even the base 1LT trim offers a luxurious ride. Standard features include an 8.0-inch touchscreen equipped with wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto integration, Mulan leather seating surfaces, and a 10-speaker Bose sound system.The 2LT trim elevates comfort with heated and ventilated seats featuring power lumbar/wing adjustments. This trim offers an engaging Performance Data Recorder that delivers real-time performance data and allows you to record high-definition video of your drive. Additional 2LT highlights include a wireless phone charger, a head-up display, and a 14-speaker Bose Performance Series sound system.Sitting at the top is the 3LT trim. Refined interior details, such as Napa leather seating surfaces and a custom leather-wrapped instrument panel, lend the cabin an especially upscale ambiance.How Much Horsepower Does the 2025 Corvette Stingray Have?The new Corvette Stingray is powered by a naturally aspirated V8 engine that produces a thrilling 495 horsepower and 470 lb-ft of torque. An agile eight-speed dual-clutch transmission delivers power to the rear wheels. Chevy's standard Driver Mode Selector lets you tailor the car's dynamics at the touch of a button. The optional Z51 Performance Package further enhances the Stingray's performance with upgrades, including an electronic limited-slip rear differential, enhanced brakes, and a performance-tuned Z51 suspension. Magnetic Selective Ride Control is also available.What Safety Features Does the 2025 Corvette Stingray Include?The new Corvette Stingray is equipped with a robust suite of advanced safety features as standard. Forward Collision Alert continuously scans ahead for potential hazards, while Side Blind Zone Alert ensures you're aware of vehicles in your blind spots. Additional safety aids include Lane Keep Assist, Automatic Emergency Braking, and a Following Distance Indicator.Visit Us In Lincoln TodayTo learn more about the new 2025 Chevrolet Corvette Stingray, contact Husker Chevrolet today. Corvette Stingray Questions * Indicates a required field Quick Links *Purchase prices do not include tax, title, license and $399.00 doc fee. Prices include the listed rebates and incentives. Please verify all information. We are not responsible for typographical, technical, or misprint errors. Inventory is subject to prior sale. Contact us via phone or email for more details. *MPG based on current year EPA mileage ratings. Use for comparison purposes only. Your mileage will vary depending on driving conditions, how you drive and maintain your vehicle, battery-pack age/condition, and other factors. Advertised prices apply to Nebraska residents only. /* DNA4535761 ddcdrewc */",
